@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title 3.0 Pendaftaran Event

actor "Visitor" as V
participant "System" as S
database "Database" as D
actor "Organizer" as O

== Daftar Event ==

V -> S : Klik "Daftar Event"
S -> D : Cek kuota & batas registrasi
D --> S : Info event
S -> D : Simpan pendaftaran (status: menunggu_verifikasi)
D --> S : Pendaftaran tersimpan
S --> V : Tampilkan kode pendaftaran (REG-xxx)

== Upload Bukti Bayar ==

V -> S : Upload bukti pembayaran
S -> D : Simpan bukti pembayaran
D --> S : Bukti tersimpan
S --> V : Tampilkan status upload

== Verifikasi Pembayaran ==

O -> S : Review bukti pembayaran
S -> D : Update status pendaftaran → lunas
D --> S : Status terupdate
S -> D : Buat data peserta baru
D --> S : Peserta terbuat
S --> V : Kirim notifikasi "Pembayaran lunas"

@enduml
